      50.64,
      407.59,
      286.46,
      466.16
    ],
    "text": "I hereby notify, under Sub-section 7, of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendments) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      470.47,
      286.46,
      579.44
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be acquired: Allotments of the Land called Sambodhiwatta, situated at Kosmodara Village of Kosmodara Grama Niladhari\u2019s Division of Kotapola Divisional Secretariat in Matara District in the Southern Province, depicted as lot No. 2297, 2298,and 2299 of supplementary No. 89 in Sheet No. 117 in FVP 45 made by Survey General, containing in extent about 0.0839 Hectares and boundaries of the land given below.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
