    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land / servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Kotapola on 29th August, 2017 at 10.00 a.m. Further, I hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 22nd August 2017, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation of the said land/servitude* the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. GANESHA AMARASINGHA, Divisional Secretary, Kotapola. At the Divisional Secretariat Office, Kotapola, 17th July, 2017.",
